\section{Conclusions}

By combining Morlet CWT flux filtering, Gegenbauer analytical derivatives, and the $2 \times 2$ factorial validation framework, `AtmosphericSlowManifold.jl` isolates wave variance and grid-spacing artifacts, proving that high-$Ri$ boundary-layer states correspond to true geometric fold dynamics on the atmospheric slow manifold.

